WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:38.270
Episode 22

01:39.450 --> 01:40.680
Uncle.

01:42.130 --> 01:44.560
What's up, Uncle Wuzhu?

01:46.690 --> 01:47.920
Uncle.

01:50.650 --> 01:51.850
Uncle.

01:53.050 --> 01:54.240
Uncle Wuzhu.

02:01.220 --> 02:03.960
Uncle! Uncle!

02:08.210 --> 02:09.010
I think I remember

02:09.010 --> 02:10.760
where the Taiping Residence is.

02:11.700 --> 02:13.200
Where is it?

02:16.450 --> 02:19.170
2.5 km east of the city.

02:21.820 --> 02:22.730
The key to my mom's box

02:22.730 --> 02:23.910
might be hidden

02:23.930 --> 02:25.600
in the Taiping Residence.

02:25.620 --> 02:26.810
If we find it,

02:26.850 --> 02:28.240
you may get your memory back.

02:28.260 --> 02:29.430
Let's go there tomorrow.

02:29.450 --> 02:30.760
No, I can't.

02:31.140 --> 02:32.210
If I rush to

02:32.210 --> 02:33.190
the Taiping Residence now,

02:33.210 --> 02:34.520
I will draw a lot of attention.

02:34.540 --> 02:35.350
Then I will go.

02:35.370 --> 02:36.560
Neither can you.

02:37.570 --> 02:38.840
I have an idea.

02:39.370 --> 02:41.370
But I need a few days for preparation.

02:42.140 --> 02:43.610
For this trip out of the capital,

02:44.140 --> 02:46.120
we'll need a lot of company.

02:46.420 --> 02:47.640
Why?

02:50.340 --> 02:52.250
Crowds can make it easier

02:52.290 --> 02:54.730
to hide the truth.

02:56.090 --> 03:04.090
Bravo! Bravo! Bravo!

03:08.420 --> 03:09.820
We've made a large purchase of paper,

03:09.820 --> 03:11.430
and the unit price is three qians higher than expected.

03:11.450 --> 03:13.370
Luckily, we've cut the number of servants.

03:13.370 --> 03:15.040
That might make up to it.

03:15.140 --> 03:17.400
Don't think about this on a trip out of the city.

03:17.450 --> 03:19.200
What's your problem, Fan Xian? Give it to me.

03:20.210 --> 03:21.400
What should you call him?

03:21.850 --> 03:22.550
Brother.

03:22.570 --> 03:23.420
Give it to me!

03:23.420 --> 03:25.330
You don't have to worry about that.

03:25.700 --> 03:27.680
Then who will take care of it?

03:27.700 --> 03:29.540
Our bookstore is going to open soon.

03:29.540 --> 03:30.570
You don't write books.

03:30.570 --> 03:32.070
You only fool around.

03:32.090 --> 03:34.280
Who asked to come along?

03:35.930 --> 03:37.760
I just want to keep an eye on him.

03:49.420 --> 03:52.370
Your Excellency, the girls are in front.

04:01.490 --> 04:02.890
You can't go inside!

04:17.490 --> 04:19.200
Ling'er also wants to go for an outing.

04:19.370 --> 04:20.590
Do you mind

04:20.610 --> 04:22.320
if we can go out together?

04:23.170 --> 04:24.240
I don't mind.

04:24.260 --> 04:26.090
More people, more fun.

04:26.770 --> 04:28.910
I don't know how you made it.

04:28.930 --> 04:30.190
The northern side of our country is at war,

04:30.210 --> 04:31.170
but His Majesty actually

04:31.170 --> 04:33.010
agreed on us coming out.

04:33.770 --> 04:35.400
We should enjoy life

04:35.420 --> 04:36.750
even when the war is intense.

04:36.770 --> 04:37.960
So the enemies can feel our confidence

04:37.980 --> 04:40.150
in winning the war.

04:40.170 --> 04:41.440
You're talking nonsense.

04:41.930 --> 04:42.650
Walking out more often

04:42.650 --> 04:44.200
is good for your health.

04:44.370 --> 04:46.010
Whatever you say.

04:47.610 --> 04:49.160
Really?

04:56.610 --> 04:58.320
I miss you.

05:00.050 --> 05:02.150
If only we could get married sooner.

05:02.170 --> 05:04.290
Then we can be together every day.

05:06.420 --> 05:07.960
Fine. Fine. Fine.

05:07.980 --> 05:09.520
I'll take another carriage.

05:09.540 --> 05:10.920
Enjoy yourselves.

05:14.770 --> 05:16.070
Lady Ye,

05:16.090 --> 05:17.460
how can you get off alone,

05:17.460 --> 05:18.960
leaving My Lady alone with that...

05:18.980 --> 05:20.440
If I stay for another minute, I'm gonna puke.

05:20.460 --> 05:20.860
If you can tolerate that,

05:20.860 --> 05:22.290
you can go inside.

05:24.210 --> 05:25.960
Can you be gentle?

05:25.980 --> 05:27.130
You...

05:28.300 --> 05:29.840
How come it's you, tigress?

05:29.860 --> 05:31.320
Where do you hide my brother?

05:32.330 --> 05:33.850
Lady Fan Ruoruo,

05:33.930 --> 05:35.370
someone acted so shamelessly

05:35.370 --> 05:36.470
in Princess Lin's carriage.

05:36.490 --> 05:37.330
It's really awkward

05:37.330 --> 05:38.870
for me to stay there.

05:38.890 --> 05:40.290
If you don't mind,

05:40.490 --> 05:42.320
I will stay with you.

05:46.580 --> 05:47.870
Come over and take a seat.

05:47.890 --> 05:49.200
Sister!

05:49.930 --> 05:51.140
How can you let her

05:51.140 --> 05:52.810
stay with us?

05:55.820 --> 05:57.530
You must protect me!

05:57.770 --> 05:59.970
Sister, you must protect me!

06:05.650 --> 06:08.530
Your trick works. Are you happy now?

06:09.300 --> 06:11.010
Those words are from the bottom of my heart.

06:18.980 --> 06:21.010
Why aren't we leaving?

06:21.090 --> 06:22.570
There's one more person to come.

06:22.930 --> 06:24.410
One more person?

06:34.170 --> 06:36.090
Xianxian!

06:36.980 --> 06:38.290
Dabao!

06:38.460 --> 06:39.760
Wan'er!

06:40.020 --> 06:41.250
I invited him.

06:42.580 --> 06:44.720
Dabao, come over now.

06:46.260 --> 06:47.750
I'll stay here.

06:47.770 --> 06:48.680
Dad said,

06:48.700 --> 06:50.140
I should... I should...

06:50.140 --> 06:50.610
I should...

06:50.610 --> 06:51.490
give

06:51.490 --> 06:52.740
Xianxian and Wan'er

06:52.740 --> 06:53.960
more private space.

06:53.980 --> 06:56.150
Good boy! You're the best.

06:56.170 --> 06:58.140
Dabao, sit well in the carriage.

06:58.140 --> 06:59.350
Let's go for an outing.

06:59.370 --> 07:01.120
Xianxian, you really know how to play.

07:01.140 --> 07:02.810
Don't call me Xianxian.

07:04.770 --> 07:06.010
OK.

07:08.260 --> 07:09.920
Xianxian!

07:17.770 --> 07:19.240
The war is on.

07:19.260 --> 07:20.580
Yan Ruohai is at the border

07:20.580 --> 07:22.350
dealing with secret information.

07:22.370 --> 07:23.840
He's terribly busy.

07:23.860 --> 07:25.350
God blesses Nanqing.

07:25.370 --> 07:27.810
We're doing really well in the war.

07:30.210 --> 07:32.760
But recently,

07:32.860 --> 07:35.250
officials from the Six Ministries start to clamor,

07:35.700 --> 07:37.040
advocating that

07:37.580 --> 07:39.410
we should capture Beiqi

07:39.490 --> 07:41.040
at one fling.

07:41.770 --> 07:43.200
Who started it?

07:44.170 --> 07:45.690
We don't know yet.

07:45.740 --> 07:47.750
But officials who take part

07:47.770 --> 07:49.350
are from Six Ministries.

07:49.370 --> 07:50.970
Investigate them thoroughly.

07:51.300 --> 07:52.210
Head...

07:52.210 --> 07:54.680
The "gnawing-away" scheme

07:54.700 --> 07:56.640
set by His Majesty is the safest.

07:57.540 --> 07:59.520
The war is about to end.

07:59.540 --> 08:02.560
Whoever advocate capturing Beiqi

08:02.580 --> 08:04.920
are traitors.

08:05.020 --> 08:07.170
Many officials from our Office

08:07.170 --> 08:08.560
also hold this view.

08:08.580 --> 08:09.330
In their opinion,

08:09.330 --> 08:11.600
it's the best chance to unify the whole world.

08:12.420 --> 08:14.680
Investigate them, punish them,

08:14.700 --> 08:16.690
or even kill them if you have to.

08:18.700 --> 08:20.250
Yes.

08:26.770 --> 08:29.200
Many people hope to capture Beiqi with one blow.

08:30.420 --> 08:33.840
The louder they advocate, the sooner they'll give up!

08:34.700 --> 08:36.120
Is Fan Xian OK?

08:36.140 --> 08:36.850
He goes for an outing

08:36.850 --> 08:38.120
with Lin Wan'er.

08:38.140 --> 08:39.240
Why don't you go along?

08:39.260 --> 08:40.270
I can't.

08:40.290 --> 08:41.290
If anything happens to you,

08:41.290 --> 08:42.770
I won't be able to get back.

08:43.900 --> 08:45.800
How can anything happen to me?

08:45.820 --> 08:46.490
Recently,

08:46.490 --> 08:48.470
there's been a secret voice against
you in the Investigator's Office.

08:48.490 --> 08:49.140
Someone is fed up with

08:49.140 --> 08:50.920
your control.

08:52.610 --> 08:53.780
Who might that be?

08:53.780 --> 08:55.810
If I know, I'll kill him.

08:56.410 --> 08:59.890
Chen Pingping, be careful about the people around you.

09:10.700 --> 09:12.010
What's up?

09:12.530 --> 09:13.910
The Head wants to investigate

09:13.930 --> 09:17.130
which officials from the Six Ministries advocate war.

09:17.340 --> 09:19.210
That's the job of your division.

09:20.290 --> 09:21.390
Recently,

09:21.410 --> 09:23.610
there have been officials meeting secretly everywhere,

09:23.610 --> 09:25.260
planning to submit a joint memorial

09:25.260 --> 09:26.930
for wiping out Beiqi at one blow.

09:26.930 --> 09:29.280
You really should carry out a thorough investigation.

09:30.170 --> 09:31.390
Last night

09:31.410 --> 09:33.080
in the residence of the Assistant
Minister of Ministry of Penalty,

09:33.100 --> 09:34.850
someone from our Investigator's Office

09:34.850 --> 09:36.520
was also there.

09:39.290 --> 09:40.020
Do you know

09:40.020 --> 09:41.840
what you've been doing?

09:43.340 --> 09:45.330
My son is still at the capital of Beiqi.

09:45.490 --> 09:47.030
The earlier Beiqi is captured,

09:47.050 --> 09:48.350
the sooner

09:48.370 --> 09:50.000
he can be safe.

09:50.020 --> 09:51.830
I haven't told the Head about it.

09:51.850 --> 09:53.770
It's not too late to stop.

09:54.260 --> 09:55.710
With the "gnawing-away" scheme,

09:55.730 --> 09:56.830
how many years will it be

09:56.850 --> 09:58.200
to capture Beiqi.

09:58.220 --> 10:00.470
We don't have a say in this.

10:00.490 --> 10:02.150
Whatever I do,

10:02.170 --> 10:03.390
I do it for Nanqing.

10:03.410 --> 10:04.680
So does the Head.

10:04.700 --> 10:05.440
He's old.

10:05.460 --> 10:06.650
Enough!

10:07.050 --> 10:09.080
Don't make me arrest you myself!

11:12.050 --> 11:14.010
Can I poke it?

11:14.900 --> 11:17.590
No! It will bite you.

11:17.610 --> 11:19.040
Is it poisonous?

11:19.410 --> 11:20.890
I don't know.

11:23.290 --> 11:25.640
Look, there's another hole here.

11:25.660 --> 11:26.460
Will it

11:26.460 --> 11:28.080
hide something inside?

11:28.850 --> 11:30.160
Childish!

11:33.290 --> 11:35.450
Poke it! Poke it!

11:40.140 --> 11:41.400
Dabao.

11:41.580 --> 11:43.000
Don't play with worms.

11:43.020 --> 11:44.610
How about learning

11:44.610 --> 11:45.810
some self-defense moves from me?

11:46.820 --> 11:48.350
Self-defense moves!

11:48.370 --> 11:49.600
Is that fun?

11:50.170 --> 11:51.400
Dabao.

11:55.220 --> 11:57.450
Don't talk to her.

11:57.730 --> 11:58.910
Don't.

11:58.930 --> 12:01.760
She is a tigress.

12:01.780 --> 12:04.200
She eats people. She's horrible.

12:04.220 --> 12:05.350
She's not.

12:05.370 --> 12:06.880
She's Wan'er's friend.

12:06.900 --> 12:08.240
She's not scary.

12:08.260 --> 12:10.120
I'm Fan Xian's younger brother.

12:10.140 --> 12:11.520
Don't you believe me?

12:12.460 --> 12:13.960
Xianxian?

12:17.020 --> 12:18.150
If you don't believe me,

12:18.170 --> 12:20.690
don't you believe Xianxian?

12:23.290 --> 12:24.200
Sister,

12:24.220 --> 12:25.530
he told me you're a tigress.

12:25.530 --> 12:26.170
Will you eat people?

12:26.170 --> 12:27.370
What?

12:28.290 --> 12:29.730
Fan Sizhe, do you need a good beat?

12:29.730 --> 12:30.370
I didn't say that.

12:30.370 --> 12:30.930
Stop!

12:30.930 --> 12:32.760
Hurry up! Run!

12:32.780 --> 12:33.610
Little one, just run!

12:33.610 --> 12:34.220
Stop!

12:34.220 --> 12:35.590
The tigress will eat you.

12:35.610 --> 12:36.610
Hurry up and run! Hurry up and run!

12:36.610 --> 12:37.220
I didn't expect them

12:37.220 --> 12:38.600
to have fun together.

12:40.290 --> 12:42.150
Dabao still retains childlike innocence.

12:42.170 --> 12:43.960
He's willing to come out with you,

12:44.140 --> 12:46.200
which means he really trusts you.

12:46.220 --> 12:47.810
We will be family in future.

12:52.100 --> 12:53.450
Thank you.

12:54.100 --> 12:55.150
Thank me for what?

12:55.170 --> 12:56.480
I know that

12:56.780 --> 12:59.280
my second brother's funeral is being
held in the Prime Minister's mansion.

12:59.970 --> 13:01.570
As a bastard daughter,

13:01.660 --> 13:03.650
I can't go there.

13:05.460 --> 13:06.830
Your father said

13:06.850 --> 13:07.460
he doesn't want Dabao

13:07.460 --> 13:08.830
to stay in the mansion, either.

13:08.850 --> 13:10.400
He said since your bother is gone,

13:10.610 --> 13:12.810
no need to make the living ones suffer.

13:13.970 --> 13:15.210
Stop!

13:15.340 --> 13:16.960
You really need a good beat!

13:17.730 --> 13:20.210
But he's my second brother after all.

13:34.780 --> 13:36.080
Where's Ruoruo?

13:36.850 --> 13:37.950
Where is she?

13:37.970 --> 13:39.350
She's probably idling around.

13:39.370 --> 13:40.600
Let her be.

13:40.850 --> 13:42.160
Have some fruit.

14:08.140 --> 14:09.240
Your Highness,

14:09.260 --> 14:11.600
the three-day punishment is over.

14:15.260 --> 14:16.590
Read these days' information

14:16.610 --> 14:17.830
to me.

14:17.850 --> 14:19.080
Yes.

14:23.140 --> 14:23.970
Recently,

14:23.970 --> 14:25.340
there have been hot debates in the imperial court.

14:25.340 --> 14:27.840
We've achieved a complete victory in the war against Beiqi.

14:30.220 --> 14:31.440
Now, many officials from different ministries

14:31.460 --> 14:33.030
want to submit a joint memorial

14:33.050 --> 14:35.130
to advocate capturing Beiqi at one blow.

14:36.050 --> 14:38.330
The Second Prince is contacting the Ministry of War.

14:41.020 --> 14:42.580
Fan Xian and Princess Wan'er

14:42.580 --> 14:43.920
left the capital city.

14:46.170 --> 14:47.320
Where did they go?

14:47.340 --> 14:48.760
They left for an outing

14:48.780 --> 14:50.130
from the South Gate.

14:51.700 --> 14:53.130
The South Gate?

14:55.490 --> 14:57.520
Yesterday, the Empress Dowager...

14:59.340 --> 15:00.370
The Prime Minister visited

15:00.370 --> 15:01.840
Princess Wan'er last night.

15:02.170 --> 15:03.960
How do we get the information?

15:04.170 --> 15:06.000
A little eunuch from Imperial Clothes Division

15:06.020 --> 15:07.820
and a guard from the imperial residence

15:07.820 --> 15:09.080
are cousins.

15:09.100 --> 15:10.950
Last night, when visiting his cousin,

15:10.970 --> 15:12.440
the eunuch saw the Prime Minister

15:12.460 --> 15:14.590
entering the residence in casual clothes.

15:14.610 --> 15:16.570
He reported the information when he came back.

15:17.100 --> 15:18.460
So Lin Ruofu secretly visited

15:18.460 --> 15:19.340
Lin Wan'er late at night

15:19.340 --> 15:21.910
without telling anyone.

15:21.930 --> 15:24.080
Don't you find it weird?

15:25.660 --> 15:27.250
What's wrong?

15:29.530 --> 15:31.710
Will Lin Wan'er

15:31.730 --> 15:33.160
tell Fan Xian about it?

15:34.140 --> 15:37.000
Now the Prime Minister roots for Fan Xian.

15:37.020 --> 15:39.040
Why should she hide it from him?

15:39.820 --> 15:41.250
Get the carriage ready!

15:41.610 --> 15:44.570
Your Highness, where are we going?

15:45.850 --> 15:47.450
Let's go for an outing.

15:51.660 --> 15:52.890
I've got it.

15:53.410 --> 15:54.470
Let me see.

15:54.490 --> 15:55.470
It's so heavy.

15:55.490 --> 15:56.890
Let me help you.

16:00.260 --> 16:02.080
What have you got?

16:10.340 --> 16:11.800
Don't tell anyone

16:11.820 --> 16:13.480
about my visit,

16:14.900 --> 16:16.480
especially Fan Xian.

16:17.850 --> 16:19.350
When you go outing tomorrow,

16:19.370 --> 16:21.210
do one thing for me.

16:22.660 --> 16:23.970
When you're out,

16:23.970 --> 16:26.690
find an excuse to go deep into the woods

16:26.820 --> 16:29.160
with Fan Xian only.

16:29.700 --> 16:31.270
Remember that

16:31.290 --> 16:35.160
no matter what happens...

16:41.290 --> 16:43.080
What's wrong? Are you OK?

16:43.730 --> 16:45.960
I'm fine.

16:46.490 --> 16:47.710
How do you feel recently?

16:47.730 --> 16:49.130
Do you feel anything wrong?

16:49.900 --> 16:51.400
Nothing.

16:51.970 --> 16:53.450
Nothing wrong.

17:04.580 --> 17:05.800
Got it!

17:05.820 --> 17:07.600
Put it down! Put it down! Put it down!

17:19.530 --> 17:20.130
The Assistant Minister of the Ministry of Rites

17:20.130 --> 17:22.600
has come to offer his condolences in person.

17:22.650 --> 17:24.170
Won't you see him?

17:24.460 --> 17:26.960
If I meet him, we will talk politely.

17:27.580 --> 17:30.010
He will say restrain your grief, and I will say thank you.

17:30.890 --> 17:32.680
It's so boring.

17:33.530 --> 17:35.250
But you should be

17:35.340 --> 17:37.050
at the mourning hall.

17:37.890 --> 17:39.200
Will my son come back to life

17:40.050 --> 17:42.250
if I'm there?

17:47.820 --> 17:49.650
Have you sent out the men?

17:50.460 --> 17:53.560
They're all martial arts masters.
They're waiting outside the capital city.

17:54.100 --> 17:56.200
But Fan Xian and Wan'er

17:56.220 --> 17:57.720
have taken out many attendants.

17:58.010 --> 17:59.530
It won't be easy for them to attack.

18:00.620 --> 18:02.320
He will leave the crowd.

18:04.500 --> 18:06.170
What on earth are you going to do?

18:06.770 --> 18:09.010
By then, Fan Xian

18:09.100 --> 18:10.770
will be attacked.

18:11.100 --> 18:12.720
You should act as if you know nothing.

18:13.170 --> 18:14.990
Don't give yourself away.

18:15.010 --> 18:15.770
Don't you support Fan Xian

18:15.770 --> 18:16.910
all along?

18:16.930 --> 18:17.650
Haven't you entrusted Fan Xian

18:17.650 --> 18:18.650
with the future of

18:18.650 --> 18:20.290
the Lin family?

18:22.770 --> 18:26.840
I still don't know who killed Gong'er.

18:27.930 --> 18:29.150
I can trust the Lin family

18:29.170 --> 18:31.010
to an outsider.

18:31.290 --> 18:33.650
But I must

18:33.650 --> 18:35.890
remove all my doubts.

18:36.380 --> 18:38.890
Were you pretending to

18:39.500 --> 18:40.990
be supportive all these days?

18:41.010 --> 18:42.370
Not really.

18:43.170 --> 18:46.930
If Fan Xian can pass this test,

18:47.130 --> 18:49.410
I really want to make him

18:49.650 --> 18:51.360
the backbone of the Lin family.

18:51.380 --> 18:53.080
The day the Second Young Master was killed,

18:53.100 --> 18:55.650
Fan Xian really didn't leave the capital city.

18:59.820 --> 19:01.650
I have a suspicion.

19:03.130 --> 19:05.290
What if there's a hidden martial arts master

19:06.050 --> 19:07.890
by Fan Xian's side,

19:08.250 --> 19:09.100
a master who could

19:09.100 --> 19:12.050
match the Four Great Masters?

19:13.170 --> 19:14.630
Fan Xian was inside the capital city,

19:14.650 --> 19:17.440
but that martial arts master killed Gong'er instead.

19:17.930 --> 19:19.480
According to Si Lili,

19:19.500 --> 19:20.910
she didn't tell Fan Xian

19:20.930 --> 19:22.290
the secret of the Second Young Master.

19:22.740 --> 19:25.250
Her words don't matter.

19:26.050 --> 19:27.480
As long as evidences show that

19:27.530 --> 19:28.650
there's a peerless martial arts master

19:28.650 --> 19:29.960
around Fan Xian,

19:29.980 --> 19:31.480
I can confirm that

19:31.500 --> 19:34.480
he's the one who killed Gong'er.

19:35.340 --> 19:36.380
That's why you asked me

19:36.380 --> 19:37.220
to send all our martial arts masters

19:37.220 --> 19:39.010
out of the city.

19:40.380 --> 19:41.840
This assassination

19:42.220 --> 19:44.770
is the final test.

19:45.500 --> 19:47.510
Dabao and Wan'er are also there.

19:47.530 --> 19:49.480
What if they get hurt...

19:50.770 --> 19:52.630
Because they are there,

19:52.650 --> 19:54.930
no one would believe that

19:55.050 --> 19:57.050
I'm the one who planned it.

20:00.220 --> 20:01.170
I hope there wouldn't be

20:01.170 --> 20:03.250
such a martial arts master.

20:11.740 --> 20:13.170
I've got it! I've got it!

20:13.460 --> 20:14.390
I told you.

20:14.410 --> 20:15.800
I don't lie.

20:15.820 --> 20:17.290
You got it, right?

20:21.650 --> 20:22.960
Now we've got two.

20:22.980 --> 20:24.530
It's your turn now.

20:26.100 --> 20:27.480
Watch me!

20:33.530 --> 20:34.770
What's wrong?

20:36.890 --> 20:38.290
I want to...

20:38.380 --> 20:39.770
You want what?

20:40.890 --> 20:43.080
I want to go somewhere quiet.

20:43.380 --> 20:44.770
Why?

20:45.530 --> 20:46.930
Wan'er.

20:48.410 --> 20:50.410
Here, it's for you!

20:51.620 --> 20:52.840
Where have you been?

20:52.860 --> 20:54.680
The flower field over there.

20:54.820 --> 20:56.510
Brother, stop sitting here as a fool.

20:56.530 --> 20:57.840
Come with me to pick some flowers.

20:57.860 --> 20:59.770
You can make Wan'er a garland yourself.

20:59.820 --> 21:01.050
OK.

21:01.130 --> 21:02.960
Wan'er, wait for a moment.

21:07.860 --> 21:09.960
Brother, I found the Taiping Residence.

21:09.980 --> 21:12.030
Walk along the river to the east, and you'll see it.

21:12.050 --> 21:13.170
OK.

21:13.250 --> 21:14.170
I'll go and see.

21:14.170 --> 21:15.510
Stay here to cover me.

21:15.530 --> 21:18.320
Brother, I'll go with you.

21:27.220 --> 21:27.620
Hurry up!

21:27.620 --> 21:29.010
Don't let them find out.

21:52.530 --> 21:53.750
Listen!

21:53.770 --> 21:55.600
When Fan Xian comes into the woods alone,

21:55.620 --> 21:56.960
we should spare no efforts in striking him down.

21:56.980 --> 21:57.840
Be careful.

21:57.860 --> 21:59.150
Don't hurt our lady.

21:59.170 --> 21:59.770
Do you understand?

21:59.770 --> 22:00.930
Yes.

22:04.170 --> 22:04.740
How's it going?

22:04.740 --> 22:05.530
They are over there.

22:05.530 --> 22:06.100
Have you seen Fan Xian?

22:06.100 --> 22:07.560
I only saw our lady. Fan Xian was not there.

22:07.580 --> 22:08.720
What?

22:09.130 --> 22:10.600
You didn't see Fan Xian.

22:11.010 --> 22:11.340
Right.

22:11.340 --> 22:13.270
I sneaked over

22:13.290 --> 22:15.480
and saw our lady and the First Young Master.

22:15.500 --> 22:17.480
But Fan Xian was not there.

22:18.930 --> 22:20.600
What's happening?

22:22.500 --> 22:23.680
Take it easy.

22:24.170 --> 22:26.410
We'll wait till he shows up.

22:26.500 --> 22:27.320
Go and check again.

22:27.340 --> 22:28.800
Yes.

22:36.050 --> 22:37.560
It's right ahead.

22:38.500 --> 22:39.460
My mom used to live

22:39.460 --> 22:40.750
in the Taiping Residence.

22:40.770 --> 22:41.410
I can't let others know

22:41.410 --> 22:42.600
I've been here.

22:42.620 --> 22:44.480
So I came up with the idea of going for an outing.

22:44.620 --> 22:45.560
I know.

22:45.580 --> 22:47.080
Your secret is safe with me.

22:47.100 --> 22:48.320
Uncle Wuzhu will be here in a moment.

22:48.340 --> 22:49.600
You haven't met yet.

22:49.650 --> 22:51.600
Is he easy to get along?

22:51.620 --> 22:52.890
He seldom talks.

22:53.530 --> 22:55.480
Are you here to mourn her?

22:55.500 --> 22:57.080
No, we're here for a key.

22:59.050 --> 23:00.370
A key?

23:02.740 --> 23:04.050
It's right ahead.

23:09.460 --> 23:11.650
Brother, here it is.

23:12.220 --> 23:14.720
My mom used to live here.

23:18.820 --> 23:20.320
There's no weed on the walls.

23:20.340 --> 23:22.170
It is well cleaned.

23:22.530 --> 23:25.150
Perhaps someone lives here.

23:25.170 --> 23:26.370
Impossible.

23:26.650 --> 23:27.980
If someone lives here,

23:27.980 --> 23:28.580
there should be smoke rising from

23:28.580 --> 23:30.250
the chimney right now.

23:30.820 --> 23:33.250
Maybe he eats early.

23:37.860 --> 23:39.480
It's so quiet around.

23:39.500 --> 23:41.290
Not even a chirp from birds.

23:42.130 --> 23:43.080
Whatever it might be,

23:43.100 --> 23:44.770
let's go over first.

23:52.930 --> 23:54.480
Brother, look.

23:54.500 --> 23:55.870
The flowers here are really beautiful.

23:55.890 --> 23:58.410
Let's fetch some for my sister-in-law.

23:59.170 --> 24:00.100
After all, we told her

24:00.100 --> 24:01.600
we're here to pick flowers.

24:01.620 --> 24:02.600
Let's hurry back.

24:02.620 --> 24:03.720
Don't keep them waiting.

24:03.740 --> 24:05.010
Here you are.

24:28.010 --> 24:29.150
Catch me!

24:29.170 --> 24:31.480
Catch me! Catch me! Catch me!

24:32.050 --> 24:34.680
I've got one! I've got one!

24:34.700 --> 24:35.480
Xianxian!

24:35.500 --> 24:37.200
Look, I've got a fish.

24:37.220 --> 24:39.480
I've got one! I've got one!

24:39.500 --> 24:41.250
Xianxian, I've got some fish.

24:41.250 --> 24:42.680
I'm not a fish.

24:43.740 --> 24:44.700
This time,

24:44.700 --> 24:47.130
I'll be the fish. Come and catch me, OK?

24:47.620 --> 24:48.960
Catch me!

24:49.650 --> 24:50.800
Catch me!

24:50.820 --> 24:53.080
Catch me! Catch me! Catch me!

25:07.700 --> 25:08.960
You are back...

25:14.410 --> 25:16.200
Your Highness!

25:16.500 --> 25:17.930
Cousin.

25:17.980 --> 25:19.150
Where's Fan Xian?

25:19.170 --> 25:20.600
He went to pick flowers.

25:20.620 --> 25:21.890
Do you want to see him?

25:21.980 --> 25:24.170
All rise. No need to make a fuss.

25:27.460 --> 25:29.050
Let's go for a walk.

25:33.890 --> 25:35.890
When Fan Xian gets back, ask him to wait for me.

25:36.170 --> 25:37.440
OK.

25:48.980 --> 25:50.960
What time is it now?

25:55.530 --> 25:56.840
It's time.

25:58.250 --> 25:59.720
What if they fail?

26:01.220 --> 26:02.250
They were kept

26:02.250 --> 26:03.340
outside the capital city before.

26:03.340 --> 26:04.390
Even if they fail,

26:04.410 --> 26:05.960
they won't get us in trouble.

26:05.980 --> 26:08.530
Moreover,

26:08.700 --> 26:11.840
they've never seen Fan Xian before.

26:11.860 --> 26:13.440
They won't give themselves away.

26:17.500 --> 26:20.770
Master, you've helped me a lot.

26:26.380 --> 26:27.750
What if there's no martial arts master

26:27.770 --> 26:30.010
by Fan Xian's side?

26:31.050 --> 26:32.930
Then I'm afraid

26:34.220 --> 26:37.250
I will never know who killed Gong'er.

26:39.930 --> 26:41.030
Boss!

26:41.050 --> 26:42.230
What's up?

26:42.250 --> 26:42.890
He left.

26:42.890 --> 26:43.750
Who left?

26:43.770 --> 26:46.230
Our lady and a young man

26:46.250 --> 26:47.960
left alone.

26:48.860 --> 26:50.820
Master Yuan has told us in advance that

26:50.820 --> 26:52.030
the man left with our lady

26:52.050 --> 26:53.560
must be Fan Xian.

26:54.050 --> 26:55.270
Remember!

26:55.290 --> 26:56.840
Later, we'll do whatever we can

26:56.860 --> 26:57.620
to make his martial arts master

26:57.620 --> 26:58.720
show up.

26:58.740 --> 26:59.440
Do you understand?

26:59.460 --> 27:00.680
Yes.

27:01.700 --> 27:02.890
Let's go!

27:13.460 --> 27:16.080
Cousin, where are your guards?

27:16.220 --> 27:17.770
My carriage is stopped far away.

27:18.770 --> 27:20.480
You're too incautious.

27:20.500 --> 27:22.600
We can't talk with them around.

27:23.290 --> 27:25.840
Cousin, what do you want to talk about?

27:30.620 --> 27:32.200
What on earth did your father

27:32.340 --> 27:34.130
tell you last night?

27:35.930 --> 27:37.250
Let me guess.

27:38.340 --> 27:40.620
Your father is still suspicious of

27:40.620 --> 27:42.360
Fan Xian.

27:42.380 --> 27:43.680
Right?

27:46.100 --> 27:47.480
It's an easy guess.

27:47.980 --> 27:50.370
Your father acts cautiously all his life,

27:50.740 --> 27:52.650
but he trusts Fan Xian

27:52.700 --> 27:54.170
too easily.

27:55.100 --> 27:58.530
It must be hard for you.

28:06.700 --> 28:09.230
Brother, I can't see the archer.

28:09.250 --> 28:10.130
Stay where you are.

28:10.130 --> 28:11.530
Brother!

28:11.930 --> 28:14.200
Don't worry. I'll be fine.

28:15.700 --> 28:16.930
Brother!

28:24.580 --> 28:26.050
Who shot the arrows?

28:43.220 --> 28:43.890
The arrow is to keep people

28:43.890 --> 28:45.370
away from the Taiping Residence.

28:48.740 --> 28:49.890
Uncle Wuzhu.

28:51.740 --> 28:53.370
Not bad.

28:54.530 --> 28:56.440
Actually, it's fine for Ruoruo to see you.

28:57.290 --> 28:58.230
Don't worry.

28:58.250 --> 29:00.050
She'll wake up in a while.

29:00.290 --> 29:02.530
I know who killed Lin Gong.

29:03.650 --> 29:05.770
Are you going to name my second cousin again?

29:08.220 --> 29:10.200
Who is he?

29:11.220 --> 29:12.680
It's not Fan Xian.

29:13.050 --> 29:14.930
You don't have to worry.

29:15.050 --> 29:16.480
Then who on earth is he?

29:16.580 --> 29:18.130
Just tell your father.

29:18.410 --> 29:21.440
The murderer is a Great Master.

29:21.700 --> 29:22.750
Then what?

29:22.770 --> 29:23.870
Tell him everything,

29:23.890 --> 29:25.560
and he will understand naturally.

29:26.410 --> 29:28.080
Why can't you tell me?

29:29.290 --> 29:31.960
It's a serious matter.

29:39.100 --> 29:41.930
Fan Xian, you'll die today.

29:42.010 --> 29:43.250
What do you call me?

29:44.650 --> 29:46.030
He's not Fan Xian.

29:46.050 --> 29:47.250
No need to lie.

29:47.700 --> 29:49.600
Fan Xian owes us a huge debt of blood.

29:49.620 --> 29:51.200
We can recognize him

29:51.220 --> 29:52.320
even if he's turned into ashes.

29:52.340 --> 29:53.650
He really isn't Fan Xian.

29:53.820 --> 29:55.870
Young lady, no need to worry.

29:55.890 --> 29:57.680
We only want to kill Fan Xian.

29:57.700 --> 29:59.320
We don't know you.

29:59.340 --> 30:00.680
We certainly won't hurt you.

30:01.100 --> 30:02.960
What's this all about?

30:03.130 --> 30:05.250
Does your father plan all of this?

30:06.290 --> 30:07.220
You...

30:07.220 --> 30:08.840
Shut up!

30:10.010 --> 30:11.030
Let me tell you.

30:11.050 --> 30:12.600
What between us is personal.

30:12.620 --> 30:14.150
It has nothing to do with the Prime Minister.

30:14.170 --> 30:15.320
If you really don't know her,

30:15.340 --> 30:17.840
how do you know her father is the Prime Minister?

30:21.620 --> 30:22.440
Brothers!

30:22.460 --> 30:23.910
Take him to somewhere quiet.

30:23.930 --> 30:25.200
Take his life.

30:25.700 --> 30:26.910
Wait! Wait!

30:26.930 --> 30:27.460
Wait!

30:27.460 --> 30:29.050
Wait! Wait!

30:29.500 --> 30:31.250
He's the Crown Prince.

30:32.170 --> 30:33.440
Well...

30:40.130 --> 30:42.110
I've seen the shots.

30:42.130 --> 30:43.390
It must be a martial arts master of the Ninth Dan.

30:43.410 --> 30:44.360
What to do now?

30:44.380 --> 30:45.440
I will hold him.

30:45.460 --> 30:46.560
You should sneak in from another direction

30:46.580 --> 30:47.860
to find the key.

30:47.860 --> 30:49.230
I've never been here.

30:49.250 --> 30:50.320
Can we switch?

30:50.340 --> 30:51.800
I'll be the diversion, and you can look for the key inside.

30:51.820 --> 30:54.270
A Ninth Dan archer is rare in the world.

30:54.290 --> 30:56.890
You're no match for him.

30:57.580 --> 30:58.380
This place is so big.

30:58.380 --> 30:59.480
Where should I start?

30:59.500 --> 31:00.930
Right opposite the square tower in the lake.

31:00.930 --> 31:02.080
Get into the bedroom.

31:02.100 --> 31:03.870
Check the bookshelf and space below the bed.

31:03.890 --> 31:05.080
You remembered!

31:05.930 --> 31:09.680
I remember something after seeing the high walls.

31:10.890 --> 31:12.200
How will you hold him?

31:26.100 --> 31:27.530
Uncle!

31:30.700 --> 31:32.930
Unbelievable!

31:39.130 --> 31:40.870
Boss, why not cover your face?

31:40.890 --> 31:43.290
No need. He has seen my face just now.

31:45.050 --> 31:46.530
It's been a while. No one has shown up.

31:46.530 --> 31:48.680
Should we let him go?

31:50.700 --> 31:54.340
Are we going to see the Prime Minister?

31:54.340 --> 31:55.840
Shut up! Back off!

31:55.860 --> 31:57.800
Go!

32:00.100 --> 32:01.630
Listen.

32:01.650 --> 32:03.110
He knows the Prime Minister is behind this.

32:03.130 --> 32:05.080
We can't let him go.

32:05.580 --> 32:07.010
What should we do?

32:08.530 --> 32:10.200
How could I know?

32:18.290 --> 32:19.720
Nothing happens.

32:21.360 --> 32:24.950
=Taiping Residence=

32:58.250 --> 33:00.050
What is he up to?

33:06.170 --> 33:07.930
A Ninth Dan archer.

33:11.400 --> 33:13.670
=Yan Xiaoyi, Director of Imperial Guards of Nanqing=

33:24.100 --> 33:26.080
Your shot was pretty good.

33:26.460 --> 33:28.480
How heavy is your bow?

33:35.530 --> 33:36.320
Go ahead.

33:36.340 --> 33:37.800
No need to get out.

33:37.820 --> 33:39.290
I'll sit right here.

33:39.380 --> 33:40.980
Shoot me if you dare.

33:40.980 --> 33:42.130
I'm here.

33:42.460 --> 33:43.680
She'll be fine.

33:45.620 --> 33:46.930
Be careful.

34:42.530 --> 34:43.970
If you dare not,

34:44.140 --> 34:45.730
I'll go inside

34:46.050 --> 34:47.600
after eating this piece.

34:57.860 --> 34:59.320
Let's go back.

35:32.180 --> 35:33.730
I've got you.

36:44.010 --> 36:45.490
No one?

36:50.820 --> 36:52.170
Let's go back.

38:13.250 --> 38:16.370
You woke up when the tree fell down.

38:25.100 --> 38:27.080
Why don't you talk?

38:27.970 --> 38:29.240
I thought

38:30.290 --> 38:31.920
you may not want to be seen.

38:31.940 --> 38:34.990
Fan Xian trusts you.

38:35.010 --> 38:36.560
Who's that archer?

38:37.180 --> 38:37.820
Has my brother

38:37.820 --> 38:38.820
entered the yard?

38:38.820 --> 38:40.560
Will he be in danger?

38:42.970 --> 38:44.450
Tell me!

38:58.450 --> 38:59.890
Your Majesty, why are you here?

39:03.900 --> 39:06.210
You should be the one to answer that question.

39:11.580 --> 39:12.580
I... I...

39:12.580 --> 39:13.920
I was on a date with Wan'er

39:13.940 --> 39:15.930
outside the capital city.

39:16.690 --> 39:19.320
Then I just idled around

39:19.820 --> 39:20.490
and walked here.

39:20.490 --> 39:21.880
I found this yard

39:21.900 --> 39:23.050
and felt thirsty.

39:23.050 --> 39:24.800
So I came in to get some water.

39:24.820 --> 39:27.970
Really? Go on.

39:28.180 --> 39:29.920
I was looking for water,

39:29.940 --> 39:31.410
and then I found Your Majesty.

39:33.420 --> 39:36.370
Do you know who once lived in this yard?

39:37.050 --> 39:38.410
I've no idea.

39:39.690 --> 39:42.170
It was an old friend of mine.

39:44.490 --> 39:46.120
When I was free,

39:46.140 --> 39:49.320
I would often visit here and take a walk.

40:04.380 --> 40:05.930
What kind of a person was she?

40:10.530 --> 40:11.800
Fan Xian,

40:12.420 --> 40:13.940
you've never knelt down

40:13.940 --> 40:16.210
before me, right?

40:16.380 --> 40:18.690
I can kneel down now if you ask.

40:19.420 --> 40:20.840
Your Majesty,

40:21.940 --> 40:23.010
a highly-skilled archer

40:23.010 --> 40:24.950
made an attack by the river just now.

40:24.970 --> 40:26.820
I'm afraid he was trying to lure the guards away.

40:26.820 --> 40:29.100
So I take the liberty to see whether Your Majesty is OK.

40:29.100 --> 40:30.650
I'm fine.

40:42.140 --> 40:44.240
If Your Majesty is fine,

40:44.660 --> 40:46.370
then I'm relieved.

40:53.940 --> 40:55.760
One more thing.

40:55.860 --> 40:58.040
Your Majesty, do you need anything to eat?

40:58.730 --> 41:00.930
I've finished my meal.

41:17.860 --> 41:19.380
This is Yan Xiaoyi,

41:19.380 --> 41:20.760
Director of Imperial Guards,

41:21.730 --> 41:23.490
a martial arts master above the Ninth Dan.

41:23.530 --> 41:26.930
He's only one step away from the Great Master.

41:28.660 --> 41:30.620
I almost forgot that

41:30.620 --> 41:32.670
martial arts master above the Ninth Dan

41:32.690 --> 41:33.900
can distinguish two people by breaths

41:33.900 --> 41:36.800
through the wall.

41:37.660 --> 41:39.400
Put down your arrow.

41:39.420 --> 41:41.890
I'm not under threat.

41:42.820 --> 41:45.560
This is Fan Xian, Chief Musician of
the Court of Imperial Sacrifices.

41:45.580 --> 41:47.640
When he leaves later,

41:47.660 --> 41:49.280
let him pass.

41:50.380 --> 41:51.650
Yes.

41:51.820 --> 41:53.000
Also,

41:53.100 --> 41:55.400
pass on my verbal instruction to the Imperial Guards.

41:55.420 --> 41:56.920
When I leave for the capital city,

41:56.940 --> 41:58.470
send a battalion

41:58.490 --> 41:59.970
to guard this place.

42:00.530 --> 42:01.600
From now on,

42:01.620 --> 42:03.840
no one shall

42:03.860 --> 42:06.040
get near this residence.

42:06.180 --> 42:07.450
Yes.

42:16.970 --> 42:18.770
You're lucky that you're still alive.

42:18.770 --> 42:20.450
You should know that martial arts master above the Ninth Dan

42:20.450 --> 42:21.660
can hear another man's breath

42:21.660 --> 42:24.190
through the wall.

42:24.210 --> 42:25.730
They can figure out my position

42:25.730 --> 42:28.120
by my voice,

42:28.140 --> 42:32.000
and then they'll shoot you.

42:32.730 --> 42:35.190
Distinguishing location by breaths through the wall,

42:35.210 --> 42:36.970
it doesn't make sense.

42:37.140 --> 42:40.130
They're beyond common sense.

43:05.600 --> 43:09.180
In the river of history,

43:09.200 --> 43:12.670
time goes round and round.

43:15.480 --> 43:18.820
Memories about the former and present lives

43:18.840 --> 43:22.910
join each other in an endless way.

43:24.800 --> 43:27.420
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:27.440 --> 43:29.680
one season follows another in a flash,

43:29.680 --> 43:32.180
and the wild geese are flying south.

43:32.200 --> 43:33.800
I just can't give up

43:33.800 --> 43:37.140
to be with you for my whole life.

43:37.160 --> 43:42.630
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

43:43.880 --> 43:46.430
